# ============================================================
# LifeSupportNode_Flow.graph
# Unity Visual Scripting  –  FlowGraph Node Specification
#
# ARCHITECTURE CONTRACT:
#   OnEnable/OnDisable static list management and OnDrawGizmos
#   stay in C#. VS reads Radius and ActiveNodeCount for HUD
#   and decay-zone visualisation.
#
# NODE MAP:
#   [Update] → [GetComponent<LifeSupportNode>]
#     → [GetMember: Radius] → [Branch: Radius changed?]
#       True → [Trigger Custom Event "OnLifeSupportRadiusChanged"]
#
# CUSTOM EVENTS:
#   "OnLifeSupportRadiusChanged" → update decay-zone gizmo / HUD ring
#
# MACHINE SETUP:
#   ScriptMachine on building prefab root alongside LifeSupportNode
# ============================================================